==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Cyberhorn]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]] are highly recommended, otherwise the Cyberhorn will have a gargantuan amount of health which will make it harder to defeat him. [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Anti-Zombie units]] such as [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Heavyweight Cat]], [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Lumbercat]], or [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]] are highly recommended to deal with the Zigge.

As with most of these stages, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] can shred the Cyberhorn with all the aforementioned treasures, along with any Zigges that may get in his way.

